<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Certification Expiring Soon – Arizona Lionhearts</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f6f9;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">
<table bgcolor="#f4f6f9" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
    <tbody>
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:20px;">
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;" width="600">

                <!-- HEADER -->
                <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="background-color:#21194f;padding:20px;">
                        <img alt="Arizona Lionhearts Logo"
                             src="https://storage.pardot.com/1126833/1781259488F0jGv9HY/Arizona_logo.png"
                             style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:480px;height:auto;border:0;" width="480">
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- BODY -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding:25px;color:#333333;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">

                        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Hi {{Recipient.FirstName}},</h2>

                        <p>This is a friendly reminder that your certification with <strong>Arizona Lionhearts</strong> is <strong style="color:#cc0000;">expiring within the next 2 weeks.</strong></p>

                        <p>To continue participating in our programs and services without interruption, please take action to renew your certification as soon as possible.</p>

                        <!-- Alert Box -->
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="15" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fff5f5;border-left:4px solid #cc0000;margin:15px 0;" width="100%">
                            <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <strong style="color:#cc0000;">⚠ Certification Expiry Notice</strong>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:10px 0;color:#333;">
                                        <li>Your certification is due to expire within <strong>2 weeks</strong></li>
                                        <li>Expired certifications may affect your program eligibility</li>
                                        <li>Renewal is quick and easy — don't wait until the last day</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Steps Box -->
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="15" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f9fafc;" width="100%">
                            <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>How to renew your certification:</strong>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:10px 0;">
                                        <li>Log in to your Arizona Lionhearts account</li>
                                        <li>Navigate to <strong>My Certifications</strong></li>
                                        <li>Follow the renewal steps and submit your documents</li>
                                        <li>Contact us if you need assistance with the process</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <p style="font-weight:bold;color:#222;margin-top:20px;">Don't let your certification lapse — renew today to stay connected with our community!</p>

                        <!-- CTA Button -->
                        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:20px auto;">
                            <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td bgcolor="#ff6b00" style="padding:12px 24px;border-radius:5px;">
                                    <a href="https://azlionhearts.com/" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Renew My Certification</a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <p>If you have already completed your renewal or believe you received this message in error, please disregard this email or contact us and we'll be happy to assist.</p>

                        <p>Warm regards,<br>
                        <strong>Arizona Lionhearts Team</strong></p>

                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- BANNER IMAGE -->
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding:0 20px 20px 20px;">
                        <img alt="Arizona Lionhearts"
                             src="http://go.pardot.com/l/1126833/2026-06-12/kqk1g6/1126833/17812598421kNacc7m/Arizona_image__2"
                             style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;border:0;" width="560">
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- FOOTER -->
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="background:#f1f1f1;padding:15px;font-size:12px;color:#555;">
                        <p style="margin:5px 0;">Contact Us - Call at <strong>480-253-9360</strong> or Text at <strong>480-253-9377</strong></p>
                        <p style="margin:5px 0;">
                            <a href="{{EmailPreferenceCenter}}" style="color:#555;text-decoration:none;">Manage Preferences</a>
                            |
                            <a href="{{Unsubscribe}}" style="color:#555;text-decoration:none;">Unsubscribe</a>
                        </p>
                        <p style="margin:5px 0;color:#888;">© 2025 Arizona Lionhearts. All rights reserved.</p>
                        <p style="margin:5px 0;color:#888;">This is an automated message. Please do not reply.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                </tbody>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>